WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.002
Two new sounds today. These two.

2
00:00:04.793 --> 00:00:07.372
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:07.872 --> 00:00:12.683
Each sound gets three things. The sound. A picture word. And a small action.

4
00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:14.436
Here is the first one.

5
00:00:15.692 --> 00:00:18.429
As in sun. Wiggle your fingers, like sunshine.

6
00:00:19.985 --> 00:00:23.253
It is a long sound. You can hold it for as long as you like.

7
00:00:23.703 --> 00:00:24.958
Here is the second one.

8
00:00:26.242 --> 00:00:28.523
As in apple. Pretend to bite an apple.

9
00:00:30.107 --> 00:00:34.067
Your mouth opens wide for this one, the way it does to bite an apple.

10
00:00:34.517 --> 00:00:38.328
You go first. Your child copies you. Do each one three times.

11
00:00:38.778 --> 00:00:45.916
If your child says the name of the letter, say: that is its name. Its sound is this. Then tap the letter under this video.

12
00:00:46.366 --> 00:00:51.997
Then say the names of the six pictures in job two together, so your child knows what each one is.

13
00:00:52.447 --> 00:00:58.890
Now step away. Your child circles the first sound of each picture, finds the letters, and traces them.

14
00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:04.745
At the end, your child says four sounds to you. Mark each one. Tomorrow starts with these two.
